omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I8Ar4JMIg38Q7kNvwEC-vag&_nc_oc=Adojqz4C4iPv2TAL5SC3y3CPFK8fkdCoVs2iw7yPvQyjdtqIAIjhjn-Su1nD1_Lx92U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0SuMmV5jGt4C7rQp8lewFBZTIT17wCNKKU_Ch1f7nbCQ&oe=69F76834"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fY5rSpw-KB4Q7kNvwGqVgjM&_nc_oc=Adp_wlKMVcb6LyZlzHt6hX7X3Dmz2GnExAAcpzg5251UZDl0-KzXkZT3peaCb6mfVs0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2ZE3iWB_i1cXpNDTBp7stPN4domPK3-bCX26LgiZciDw&oe=69F76996"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7yKipM4LxXwQ7kNvwHu_nxz&_nc_oc=Adqt37TV_8poTOVCMud7zfB4lvAeJ46Fou6rOWbQDkBJGaL9wdvDdjQH826LUIwR_lI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1GiJtiCcm3iCPRKAFjOBAwnL7uZhEFpZkb3BCYo5O8Ig&oe=69F74677"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://